      "algorithmDescription": "Computes the weighted average unit inventory cost across two purchase lots. Each lot's quantity (PIC 9(3)) and unit cost (PIC 9(3)V99) are multiplied into exact 2-decimal extended cost fields (EXT-1 and EXT-2, PIC 9(6)V99), the quantities are summed into TOT-QTY (PIC 9(4)), and the combined extended cost is divided by TOT-QTY into UNIT-AVG (PIC 9(4)V99) using ROUNDED (half-up to 2 decimal places).",
      "contract": {
        "inputFields": [
          {
            "name": "QTY-1",
            "cobolPicture": "PIC 9(3)",
            "description": "Unit quantity for purchase lot 1"
          },
          {
            "name": "COST-1",
            "cobolPicture": "PIC 9(3)V99",
            "description": "Unit cost for purchase lot 1"
          },
          {
            "name": "QTY-2",
            "cobolPicture": "PIC 9(3)",
            "description": "Unit quantity for purchase lot 2"
          },
          {
            "name": "COST-2",
            "cobolPicture": "PIC 9(3)V99",
            "description": "Unit cost for purchase lot 2"
          }
        ],
        "stdinFormat": "Four newline-separated strings: QTY-1 (integer), COST-1 (decimal), QTY-2 (integer), and COST-2 (decimal).",
        "validInputDomain": "QTY-1 and QTY-2 integers in [1, 999]; COST-1 and COST-2 decimals in [0.00, 999.99] with at most 2 decimal places.",
        "outputMeaning": "Single scalar decimal representing the weighted average unit cost UNIT-AVG at scale 2.",
        "outputNormalization": "Trim surrounding whitespace, strip optional leading '+' sign and leading integer zeros (preserving '0' before the decimal point), and format as an exact decimal string with 2 fractional digits (0.00).",
        "semanticAssumptions": [
          "Working-storage intermediate fields: EXT-1 PIC 9(6)V99, EXT-2 PIC 9(6)V99, TOT-QTY PIC 9(4), UNIT-AVG PIC 9(4)V99.",
          "Because QTY-1 and QTY-2 are integers in [1, 999], TOT-QTY is in [2, 1998] (never zero), EXT-1 and EXT-2 are exact at scale 2 without truncation and bounded by 998990.01, and UNIT-AVG is bounded by 999.99.",
          "COMPUTE UNIT-AVG ROUNDED = (EXT-1 + EXT-2) / TOT-QTY divides total extended cost by total units and rounds half-way values away from zero at scale 2."
        ]
